        access: 'Transport Canberra’s timetable in effect on 12 October 2026 lists Route 53 from Dickson through Hackett, Ainslie, City and ANU Acton to the National Museum. Check the direction, stop, weekend service and return time for your date. As reviewed on 12 October 2026, the Museum lists daily 9am–5pm opening, with some exhibitions and events carrying a charge. Its visit page says requests to see collection objects not on display need an advance appointment; that condition is not a general appointment rule for entering the public museum. Visitors who need a shorter outdoor approach can use the museum’s accessibility map and current parking information rather than assuming that the whole foreshore has even shade or shelter.',
